{{- /*
second_factor.gohtml is the signed-in person's own second factor (ADR 0266).

It is open to everybody who can sign in: enrolling is an act of identity
(ADR 0264), and a person the installation requires a factor of holds no
privilege until they enrol (ADR 0265), so this is where the door sends them.

The secret is printed ONCE, right after it was drawn, as text and as an
otpauth link a phone's authenticator can open; there is no QR code, because
drawing one would take a dependency the panel does not carry. Changing or
removing a proven factor takes the code it shows now, as the API does.
*/ -}}
{{ define "body" }}
<h1>{{ .Title }}</h1>

{{ if .Error }}<p role="alert">{{ .Error }}</p>{{ end }}

{{ if .Owed }}
<p role="alert">This installation requires a second factor, and this account has not proven one. Until it does, no other screen opens.</p>
{{ else if and .Unprivileged (not .Proven) }}
<p class="muted">This account holds no privilege that opens another screen. It can still protect itself here.</p>
{{ end }}

{{ with .Enrollment }}
<h2>Add this key to your authenticator</h2>
<p>It is shown this once. Type it into the app, or open the link on the phone that holds the app.</p>
<p><code>{{ .Secret }}</code></p>
{{ if .Link }}<p><a href="{{ .Link }}">Open in the authenticator</a></p>{{ end }}
{{ end }}

{{ if .Proven }}
<p>This account is protected by an authenticator.</p>
{{ else }}
<p>This account has no second factor.</p>
{{ end }}

{{ if .Waiting }}
<h2>Prove the new authenticator</h2>
<form method="post" action="{{ .ConfirmPath }}">
  <label>The six digits it shows
    <input type="text" name="code" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="one-time-code" required>
  </label>
  <button type="submit">Confirm</button>
</form>
{{ end }}

<h2>{{ if .Proven }}Move to a new authenticator{{ else }}Add an authenticator{{ end }}</h2>
<form method="post" action="{{ .EnrollPath }}">
  {{ if .Proven }}
  <label>The six digits your current authenticator shows
    <input type="text" name="code" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="one-time-code" required>
  </label>
  {{ end }}
  <button type="submit">Draw a new key</button>
</form>

{{ if .Proven }}
<h2>Remove the authenticator</h2>
<form method="post" action="{{ .RemovePath }}">
  <label>The six digits it shows
    <input type="text" name="code" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="one-time-code" required>
  </label>
  <button type="submit">Remove</button>
</form>
{{ end }}
{{ end }}
